### Verify registration OTP
### Activates account, assigns CUSTOMER role, creates CustomerProfile.
### Replace 'otp' with the 6-digit code from server log or email.

POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "otp": "123456"
}
